            </S412:fixedDateRange>
            <S412:weatherWarningMessage>
                <S412:information>
                    <S412:language>eng</S412:language>
                    <S412:text>Freezing rain along the St. Lawrence River downstream of Pointe-aux-Trembles from 2300Z 28 October 2025 until 1100Z 29 October 2025. Ice accumulation rates of 0.7 to 2 centimetres per hour are forecast on vessel superstructures, decks and rigging.</S412:text>
                </S412:information>
                <S412:information>
                    <S412:language>fra</S412:language>
                    <S412:text>Pluie verglacante sur le fleuve Saint-Laurent en aval de Pointe-aux-Trembles de 2300Z le 28 octobre 2025 jusqu a 1100Z le 29 octobre 2025. Taux d accumulation de glace de 0,7 a 2 centimetres par heure prevus sur les superstructures.</S412:text>
                </S412:information>
            </S412:weatherWarningMessage>
            <S412:issueDate>2025-10-28</S412:issueDate>
            <S412:issueTime>17:00:00Z</S412:issueTime>
            <S412:weatherWarningNumber>IAW-2025-1028-007</S412:weatherWarningNumber>
